/* DATA DESCRIPTION:
Citation:	Eisen, Olaf; Eagles, Graeme; Steinhage, Daniel; Helm, Veit; Binder, Tobias (2025): ANT 2016/17: AWI airborne Radio-Echo Sounding data over central Dronning Maund Land and around the Dome Fuji ice core site (OIR Dome F and GEA-Vb-FMA projects) [dataset]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.982745
Abstract:	This dataset contains airborne radar data acquired using the AWI EMR system during the Antarctic season of 2016/17 to investiage the geodynamic evolution of East Antarctica, and for the Beyond EPICA - Oldest Ice reconnaissance around Dome Fuji. The profiles extend across the central Dronning Maud Land across the Jutulstraumen drainage basin, around the EDML ice core site and around Dome Fuji. The data are available as netCDF files (including waveforms and metadata), KML files of the profile line locations, and quicklook images of the radargrams.
Keyword(s):	Antarctic Ice Sheet; AWI EMR; Dome Fuji; Dronning Maud Land; EDML; Ice core; Polar 6; radio-echo sounding
Related to:	Eisen, Olaf; Steinhage, Daniel; Franke, Steven; Helm, Veit; Binder, Tobias; Drews, Reinhard; Eagles, Graeme; Humbert, Angelika; Jansen, Daniela; Jokat, Wilfried; Lambrecht, Astrid; Mieth, Matthias; Riedel, Sven; Miller, Heinrich (2024): Collection of datasets from AWI's radio-echo sounding systems on ice sheets and glaciers [dataset bibliography]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.972094
